    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/c0530d159a3de5c5c633d09f59499db2.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div><br>Spacelair is a retro sidescroller arcade adventure that combines some real life dependencies with old fashion parallax graphics. You are introduced to the town of Juv\u00e9l\u00e5sen, a small coastal village with (among other things) a fishing boat and a spaceship factory. Theme of the story is an apocalypse followed by a narrow escape and some daring space exploration. Remember to buy that fan and some food, and good luck.. ;)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/c8a866741f6604a898f1711e34258a95.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/0c7dae9b2ee17647dc9bef94876cdd2e.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div><br>Free to play and use as a development platform for other Python Pygame developers, and only 2,99 USD for Windows and Linux users including all future updates. Players are encouraged to comment this game and help the developer complete the Spacelair release adventure..<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/b2e3524d9fb110c07c911786da9891e8.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div>   <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/1701345be978596a1086e087d8c27ae8.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div><br>Sporadic updates based on Community feedback, with improved graphics, gameplay, missions, story ++<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/15a7c171e53ed93a3d253b87cbdd6f38.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/a9c71af1c76ca4f49e1e0f97e0d19300.webp?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/d640cd57682337b5a5cf8b939607b05a.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/977217922e607a92fef6d09676b1c7be.webp?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/593b3eb1c48ebde817532786ca4c9e88.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/c0530d159a3de5c5c633d09f59499db2.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div><br>Spacelair is a retro sidescroller arcade adventure that combines some real life dependencies with old fashion parallax graphics. You are introduced to the town of Juv\u00e9l\u00e5sen, a small coastal village with (among other things) a fishing boat and a spaceship factory. Theme of the story is an apocalypse followed by a narrow escape and some daring space exploration. Remember to buy that fan and some food, and good luck.. ;)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/c8a866741f6604a898f1711e34258a95.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/0c7dae9b2ee17647dc9bef94876cdd2e.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div><br>Free to play and use as a development platform for other Python Pygame developers, and only 2,99 USD for Windows and Linux users including all future updates. Players are encouraged to comment this game and help the developer complete the Spacelair release adventure..<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/b2e3524d9fb110c07c911786da9891e8.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div>   <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/1701345be978596a1086e087d8c27ae8.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div><br>Sporadic updates based on Community feedback, with improved graphics, gameplay, missions, story ++<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/15a7c171e53ed93a3d253b87cbdd6f38.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/a9c71af1c76ca4f49e1e0f97e0d19300.webp?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/d640cd57682337b5a5cf8b939607b05a.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/977217922e607a92fef6d09676b1c7be.webp?t=1553283232\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014450/extras/593b3eb1c48ebde817532786ca4c9e88.avif?t=1553283232\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Spacelair is a retro sidescroller arcade adventure with various gameplay challenges; health, air, food, work, education, energy, purchase buildings, mini-missions, greenhouses and without violence or shooting. Dive into the parallax future and discover your lair today!!",
