    "legal_notice": "Spacelair.py is free to play and use as a platform for Python developers, please upload and share the .py file and not a compiled version. Skilled Indie developers interested in partnership are encouraged to contact Bodin Concept to join the Bodin Concept team and develop the Spacelair game with more and new features. Please respect the \"1 compiled game per pay\" policy. If you give the game a positive comment and a Facebook/Instagram/Twitter and/or YouTube \"like\" you\u00b4ll get a free game license on Steam. Issues regarding abuse or misuse of the brand 'Spacelair' will, in worst case, be solved with lawyers asap.<br />\r\nHope you enjoy, Espen-Andr\u00e9 Bodin",
